    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγν-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>close</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώματι τὸ ἀγγεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					17(2).160
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				161
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1
			</span></i>
            <u>Praef.</u>, al.; of the pores, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).145
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make</i> a building <i>watertight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).154
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				36
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				161
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				114
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>): —
				Pass.
			, of embankments, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώματα ἐστεγνωμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.315.25
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make costive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>
			<u>Praef.</u> (
				Pass.
			); <i>check discharge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτρα ἐστεγνωμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτα πυορροοῦντα στεγνοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.81
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>compress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάπυρος στεγνουμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.86
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔριον μαλακὸν
			ἐστενωμένον</span> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστεγνωμένον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				46.19.2
			</span></i>.</div>
